# nord-rand — rotate NordVPN to a random country (from `nordvpn countries`) every 6 hours.
#
# Install:  crontab nord-job/nord-rand.cron              (run from repo root; replaces your crontab)
# List:     crontab -l
# Remove:   crontab -r                                    (removes ALL your cron jobs)
#
# Field order: minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week command
# 0 */6 * * *  =  at minute 0, every 6th hour, every day  →  00:00, 06:00, 12:00, 18:00

0 */6 * * * $HOME/.local/bin/nord-rand force >/dev/null 2>&1
